guide forever/horde/50-60/07-felwood
title Felwood, Moonglade & Winterspring
faction Horde
levels 58-60
zone Felwood
# Built from the simulator's consensus route (Horde, visits 102-116) and
# machine-checked with lint; not play-tested on Forever yet. The end of the
# Horde leveling chain.
#
# Optional here: Toxic Horrors and Winterfall Runners (5086, 5087), which
# follow a rare Winterspring drop, and Runecloth (6031), which Meilosh takes
# only at Neutral with the Timbermaw.
#
# Flow: the Undercity -> zeppelin to Orgrimmar (cloth donations) -> fly to
# Splintertree Post -> ride north into Felwood: the Emerald Sanctuary (Greta,
# Eridan) -> Jaedenar's braziers -> the Sanctuary -> Shadow Hold -> the
# Sanctuary -> north past Jaedenar to Bloodvenom Post (Winna, Trull) ->
# Irontree Woods -> Timbermaw Hold (Meilosh) -> through the tunnel to
# Moonglade (Umber, Rabine) -> back through Timbermaw Hold into Winterspring
# (Donova Snowden) -> Everlook (Umi) -> grind to 60 at Frostwhisper Gorge.
#
# Deviations from the export, for a smooth finish:
# - Felwood is one pass from south to north. Greta Mosshoof's chain (5159,
#   5165, 5242) and Linken's Memory (3942) are done at the Emerald Sanctuary
#   on the way in; Jaedenar is only a couple of minutes north of it, so the
#   two short returns to Greta stay in. Dropped: Silver Heart and Aquementas
#   (4084, 4005: the Irontree Heart is in northern Felwood, a second ride
#   south to hand in). Trull's Wild Guardians turn-in (4741) and the Toxic
#   Horrors (5086) come on the way north; the export's second Felwood visit
#   is folded in.
# - Dropped trips that cost a long flight or ride for a few quests: the
#   Blasted Lands, Swamp of Sorrows and Burning Steppes stops (3501, 2623,
#   2801, 2681, 2702, 2701, 4810; the Fallen Hero's chain is worth well under
#   a third of a level behind a flight from the Undercity and a zeppelin
#   back), Stranglethorn (1036, 4621: Bloodsail reputation and elite targets;
#   8240: a Zul'Gurub raid item), the Burning Steppes' Mother's Milk (4866:
#   Blackrock Spire), Alterac Mountains (7241: a battleground quest, dropped
#   with its accept), Ratchet and Duke Hydraxis after 60 (4502, 6804, 6805).
# - The Undercity stop moved first (the route starts next to it) and holds no
#   quests any more: Champion of the Banshee Queen (5961) and the Eastern
#   Plaguelands stop (6030, 5142) went to 06; ... and a Batch of Ooze (4294)
#   needs Un'Goro slime samples the route never collects.
# - The two Orgrimmar stops are one, on the way to Felwood: the runecloth
#   donations (7836, 7824). Calm Before the Storm (4509, 4511) went with Pawn
#   Captures Queen in 06; Betrayed (3507) is turned in by 04.
# - No hearth binds: the guide ends where it grinds. The export's binds (the
#   Undercity, Booty Bay, Orgrimmar, Everlook, Light's Hope) served the
#   dropped trips.
# - With the dropped trips the route ends on a grind (about 59.2 to 60):
#   Rabid Shardtooths at Frostwhisper Gorge, the export's own final camp. A
#   group dungeon is the optional alternative.
#
# Left out (besides the above): the Undercity's cloth donations (7813, 7814,
# 7817), Camp Mojache (7492) and Vivian Lagrave (4769), never turned in;
# Shards of the Felvine (5526: Dire Maul); Wild Guardians' last part and
# Guarding Secrets (4721, 4882: turned in back at Bloodvenom Post).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Orgrimmar

step Zeppelin to Orgrimmar
  zone Orgrimmar
  tip From the Undercity, take the zeppelin from the tower outside the city to Orgrimmar.
  turnin 7836
  turnin 7824

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Southern Felwood

step The Emerald Sanctuary
  zone Felwood
  tip Fly to Splintertree Post and ride north-west along the road out of Ashenvale into Felwood. The Emerald Sanctuary is the druids' camp just past the border.
  fly "Splintertree Post"
  turnin 5159                         -- Greta Mosshoof
  accept 5165
  turnin 3942                         -- Eridan Bluewind
  note Eridan's Silver Heart needs an Irontree Heart from northern Felwood and a ride back here. Skip it.

step Dousing the Flames of Protection
  tip Ride north-west to Jaedenar. The four braziers stand among the Shadow Council's buildings; use the Cleansed Water on each one.
  interact 176158 quest 5165.1
  interact 176159 quest 5165.2
  interact 176160 quest 5165.3
  interact 176161 quest 5165.4

step Greta Mosshoof
  tip Back south to the Sanctuary, a short ride.
  turnin 5165
  accept 5242

step A Final Blow
  tip Moora, Salia and Shadow Lord Fel'dan wait at the back of Shadow Hold, the cave in Jaedenar's north. Clear the tunnel as you go.
  kill 9861 quest 5242.1
  kill 9860 quest 5242.2
  collect 13207 quest 5242.3

step Greta Mosshoof
  tip South to the Sanctuary once more.
  turnin 5242

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Northern Felwood

step Bloodvenom Post
  tip Ride north along the road, past Jaedenar, to Bloodvenom Post.
  turnin 6605                         -- Winna Hazzard
  turnin 4741                         -- Trull Failbane
  note Trull's next Wild Guardians would bring you back here from Winterspring. Skip it.

step Toxic Horrors
  tip Only if Donova gave you Toxic Horrors: ride north up the Felwood road to Irontree Woods; the Toxic Horrors ooze between the trees.
  collect 12822 quest 5086.1 optional

step Meilosh
  tip Only with 30 Runecloth, and only at Neutral with the Timbermaw: follow the road north to Timbermaw Hold; Meilosh trades just inside the entrance.
  turnin 6031 optional

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Moonglade

step Umber
  zone Moonglade
  tip Through the Timbermaw tunnel to Moonglade. Umber reads in a house in Nighthaven.
  turnin 6844
  accept 6845

step Rabine Saturna
  turnin 5527
  turnin 6845
  note Rabine's Shards of the Felvine needs Dire Maul. Skip it.

step Umber
  accept 1185
  turnin 1185

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Winterspring

step Donova Snowden
  zone Winterspring
  tip Back into the Timbermaw tunnel and take the Winterspring exit; Donova camps by the hot springs just outside.
  turnin 5086 optional
  accept 5087 optional

step Winterfall Runners
  tip Only if you carry Winterfall Runners: the runners walk the road from Timbermaw Hold toward Winterfall Village in small groups; wait by the road near Donova and kill them as they pass. Each one carries a crate.
  collect 12829 quest 5087.1 optional
  turnin 5087 optional                -- Donova Snowden
  note Donova next sends you after High Chief Winterfall, an elite in his cave. Skip it.

# Group quests (sim elites): High Chief Winterfall, about 18 min saved for a party
step High Chief Winterfall
  when group 5121
  accept 5121

step High Chief Winterfall
  when group 5121
  tip High Chief Winterfall is elite: grouping up is advised.
  kill 10738 quest 5121.1

step High Chief Winterfall
  when group 5121
  turnin 5121

step Everlook
  tip Ride east along the road to Everlook.
  turnin 5163                         -- Umi Rumplesnicker

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Level 60

step Dungeon instead of grinding
  tip Optional. Running Stratholme, Scholomance, Lower Blackrock Spire or Blackrock Depths with a group instead of grinding gets you there faster.
  note Optional: with a group, a 55-60 dungeon replaces the grind below.

step Grind to 60
  tip The quests run out here. Rabid Shardtooths prowl Frostwhisper Gorge in southern Winterspring, south of the road from Everlook.
  goto 60.1,71.2 "Frostwhisper Gorge"
  level 60 -- grind on Rabid Shardtooth at Frostwhisper Gorge, Winterspring
  train class optional only Warrior,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock -- In Orgrimmar: fly from Everlook
  train class optional only Druid,Paladin -- In Thunder Bluff: fly from Everlook
